    "ja-ro": "Minamiza the Super Evolution"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Minami is a high school girl who feels totally average. She's tired of blending into the background and thinks her life is boring. Daydreaming about excitement and maybe a trip to New York, she gets inspired by her favorite anime. \n\nShe tries to show off a dramatic special move to her friend Nakamura and it completely fails. Minami swears she actually did have powers yesterday, breaking a mug with the move. Nakamura isn't buying it. But then, weird things start happening at school, like classroom windows shattering for no reason. Could Minami's fantasies be real? Later, she tries her power move again. \n\nThis time, it works spectacularly, stopping rain in mid-air! Minami finally has proof: she has superpowers. She's not ordinary anymore.",
   "ja": "高校３年生のミナミはある日突然、超能力が開花する。\n\n中学・高校でのデビューもパッとせず、味気なかった彼女の青春はこの超能力をきっかけに次第に色を帯びていき…。\n\n毎日は普通でいいけれど、普通だけじゃつまらない！\n\n少しぎこちなくも周囲も巻き込み、能力と共にやり残した青春を取り戻す、サイキック発動系ヒロインの能力無駄遣い微青春譚、ここに始動－－!!"
  },
